            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Streiter, Oliver and Goudin, Yoann, \"Bury your Past, Shovel it under, Histories and Caterpillars on Taiwan's Graveyards\", First Workshop on Documenting and Researching Gravesites in Taiwan, 2011.\n\nStreiter, Oliver and Goudin, Yoann and Huang, Chun (Jimmy), \"ThakBong, Digitalizing Taiwan's Tombstones for Teaching, Research and Documentation\", TELDAP 2010 - The International Conference on Taiwan e-Learning and Digital Archives Program, 2011.\n\nStreiter, Oliver and Huang, Chun (Jimmy), \"數墓:台灣墓碑數位為典藏、教學、及研究\", in: 數位鬥陣-99 年度數位內容公開徵選計畫成果展, 2011.\n\nStreiter, Oliver and Huang, Chun (Jimmy) and Goudin, Yoann, \"The Space of Gravesites, Tackling Culture with Simple GIS Tools\", 3rd International Conference of Digital Archives and Digital Humanities, 2011."
